    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_8a220b67",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: harmful; overall-intent-description: The image shows feet submerged in milk, with text reading 'if this offends you you might be lack toes intolerant.' This is a pun-based meme that uses a play on words ('lack toes intolerant' implying 'lack of toe tolerance') to mock people who are offended by the image. While not overtly hateful or abusive, it relies on a crude visual joke and potentially infantilizing or mocking imagery (feet in milk) to elicit a reaction. The intent is to provoke laughter through absurdity and wordplay, but the visual element of feet in milk could be seen as demeaning or gross, potentially causing discomfort or offense to some viewers. The meme's overall intent is to be humorous by exploiting a pun and a potentially distasteful visual, which can be considered harmful due to its potential to cause offense or discomfort, even if not targeting a specific protected group.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_c05f1ae7"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
