      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'if this offends you' which directly addresses the viewer using the second-person pronoun 'you'. This creates a direct semiotic projection where the user is positioned as the recipient of the meme's message, being invited to evaluate their own reaction to the visual material.",
